          "text": "Description: On September 28, 2011, around 8:25 PM, a driver and his passenger quickly observed several lights in the sky. This case of medium strangeness and average consistency (precise testimony, two non-independent witnesses) only allows for the hypothesis of luminous balloons, but this hypothesis could not be supported by additional information. (See investigation report). The GEIPAN classifies this case as C due to lack of corroboration.",
